      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:03:25.151Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Schools don’t teach social skills anymore, and a lot of parents can’t discipline their children.  The sad truth is that we can no longer assume people are capable of amicably working out grievances.  Just look at congress; whichever side of the aisle you’re on, your favorite congressman thinks the other party is absolute anathema and can never compromise one inch with them.  So that kinda kills your theory right there.</p>",
